{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43287","headline":"白珪无玷 · 辛宏","name":"白珪无玷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"片玉表坚贞，逢时宝自呈。\n色鲜同雪白，光润夺冰清。\n皎皎无瑕玷，锵锵有佩声。\n崑山标重价，垂棘振香名。\n抱璞心常苦，全真道未行。\n琢磨忻大匠，还冀动连城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"辛宏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43287.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43287","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}